@format 1
@id funnel.dispatch
@title Dispatch files through funnel
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Match selected or all listed files against ordered funnel rules and deliver each first match to its target tab.
@section I. UI
@tabs Funnel
@flow TB
@related relay.receive-tab

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PFunnelTab
@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier
@alias seal = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LSeal

[input] Funnel action requested <input>
- Receive selected or all listed items @ tab.PFunnelDispatch(...)
> match

[match] Match ordered rules <decision>
- Test each filename and stop at its first rule with a usable target @ tab.PFunnelDispatch(...)
? "No rule with a live target matches" > unmatched
? "A live target matches" > deliver

[deliver] Deliver matched files <process>
- Add each matched file to the target list with its cohort and delivered state @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
- Remove delivered sources when empty-target-files preference is enabled @ list.PListPathsRemove(...)
- Record courier arrival and sweep completed cohorts @ courier.LCourierArrive(...)
@ seal.LSealSweep(...)
> result

[result] Funnel dispatch complete <output>
= Matched files reach their first live target and cohort routing is updated.

[unmatched] Nothing dispatched <output>
= Unmatched files remain in the Funnel list.
